From ffae7d43d5fc071b9594eec0338c9cb7b405acd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yashar Fakhari <YasharF.Git1@ydftech.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 19:24:20 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 049/200] fix: minor bugs and improvements

- Split passport-oauth into passport-oauth1 and passport-oauth2 to make it easier to strip unused dependencies when starting a new project using this boilerplate.
- Add missing autocomplete in profile views.
- Add missing list-inline in the footer partial.
- Add QR to the package table in README.md.
- Add missing next parameter in the error handler in app.js.
